#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: npcink-abilities-toolkit.php
msgid "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"
msgstr "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"

#. Description of the plugin
#: npcink-abilities-toolkit.php
msgid ""
"Standalone WordPress Abilities API package toolkit for safely exposing "
"agent-callable abilities."
msgstr ""
"Kit de herramientas de paquete independiente para WordPress Abilities API "
"que expone de forma segura capacidades invocables por agentes."

#. Author of the plugin
#: npcink-abilities-toolkit.php
msgid "Npcink"
msgstr "Npcink"

#: includes/Admin/Health_Notices.php:69
msgid ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit is active, but the WordPress Abilities API "
"registration functions are unavailable. Update WordPress to 6.9 or later, or"
" enable the WordPress Abilities API baseline, before AI clients can discover"
" this site's abilities."
msgstr ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit está activo, pero las funciones de registro de "
"WordPress Abilities API no están disponibles. Actualiza WordPress a 6.9 o "
"posterior, o activa la línea base de WordPress Abilities API, antes de que "
"los clientes de IA puedan descubrir las capacidades de este sitio."

#: includes/Admin/Health_Notices.php:76
msgid ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit is active, but no abilities are registered on this "
"site yet. Review the ability status page, or check that a host product has "
"not disabled the built-in ability packages."
msgstr ""
"Npcink Abilities Toolkit está activo, pero aún no hay capacidades "
"registradas en este sitio. Revisa la página de estado de capacidades o "
"comprueba que un producto host no haya desactivado los paquetes de "
"capacidades integrados."

