"The restore target changed while its compensation copy was being created."
msgstr ""
"El objetivo de restauración cambió mientras se creaba su copia de "
"compensación."

#: includes/Packages/Write_Traits/Media_Backup_Write_Methods.php:775
msgid ""
"The completed media restore could not remove its transient compensation "
