msgid "The Cloud Addon receive facts are invalid."
msgstr "Los datos de recepción de Cloud Addon no son válidos."

#: includes/Support/Cloud_Derivative_Artifact.php:346
msgid "The Cloud Addon receive facts did not match the reviewed artifact."
msgstr ""
"Los datos de recepción de Cloud Addon no coincidieron con el artefacto "
"revisado."

